# Representative typed state-machine Delta slice.

sum Mode stop go end
record Pair left word right word end
record Other left word end
array Slots word 4

machine decrement 1 value word result word
state decrement_entry
const result 1
sub result value result
return result
end

machine sum_down 3 value word step word accumulator word result word
local next word
local next_accumulator word
state sum_start
brzero value sum_done sum_recurse
state sum_recurse
sub next value step
add next_accumulator accumulator value
call result sum_down 3 next step next_accumulator
return result
state sum_done
copy result accumulator
return result
end

machine main 1 value word answer word
local one word
local count word
local recursive_result word
local mode Mode
local pair Pair
local slots Slots
state start
const one 1
const count 3
call recursive_result sum_down 3 count one one
write recursive_result
construct mode Mode go
field-set pair left count
index-set slots 0 count
switch mode Mode stop done go loop endswitch
state loop
field-get count pair left
call count decrement 1 count
field-set pair left count
index-set slots 0 count
brzero count done loop
state done
index-get answer slots 0
halt answer
end

entry main start
